"reference_id": 13580,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "3 John 1:4",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "64001004",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>Like in 2 John (see <a href=\"https://ref.ly/2John1:1-2John1:4\">2&nbsp;John 1:1–4</a>), John emphasizes the importance of knowing and following the truth. This stands in contrast to Diotrephes and those who follow him (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/3John1:9\">3&nbsp;John 1:9</a>).</p>",
