"reference_id": 13582,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "3 John 1:5",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "64001005",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>Gaius welcomed the traveling teachers (literally <em>the brothers</em>) who went from church to church to support the apostles’ teaching about Christ (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/3John1:7-3John1:8\">1:7–8</a>). By doing this, Gaius demonstrated that he had received the truth from the apostles and was faithful to God.</p>",
